#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
update — universal system updater
Config: ~/.config/update.yaml

The config is trusted executable configuration: commands are run through the
shell so the file must remain owned by the user and not be group/world writable.
Persistent history and logs live under ~/.update. Runtime output files should
use UPDATE_TMPDIR, a private per-run directory.

Runtime Python dependencies: PyYAML and Rich. The interactive stats dashboard
also requires Textual and plotext.
"""

